\begin_layout Standard

\series bold
In both simulation environments
\series default
 (Inverted Pendulum and Hopper),
 kCELL successfully adapts to changes in dynamics as indicated by the consistently decreasing MAE on the test dataset corresponding to the currently observed gravity value (indicated by the semi-transparent red shaded areas in Figure 
