Certifiability for ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance Systems) refers to the process of proving that these safety-critical systems meet rigorous regulatory,
 safety,
 and performance standards to gain formal approval for deployment in vehicles.
 It ensures systems like automatic emergency braking or lane-keeping assist operate reliably without introducing undue risks.
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset


