\begin_layout Plain Layout
The goal of this chapter is to evaluate the requirements for developing a speed recommendation system that can be deployed in real-world conditions and how the work in this thesis contributes to this.
 In this thesis the speed Recommendation Problem has been abstracted to a Human-Robot Collaboration (HRC) Problem.
 
